Iridium 1.0.27 - Shop UX Improvements

🔧 Client Bot Section:
- Token input shows only when bot is stopped
- After start, shows settings form only (no token)
- Save settings auto-restarts bot

📋 Tariff Modal:
- Prices for 1, 3, 6, 12 months
- Traffic limit field only for limited tariffs
- Unlimited/Limited type selector

🎁 Promo Modal:
- Dynamic fields based on promo type
- Discount: % field
- Free period: days field  
- Extra traffic: GB field

🐛 Fixes:
- Fixed infinite loading issue
- Section visibility now works correctly
